Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's really\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world has\Nhappened to our beloved king?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole kingdom's in disarray!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked amiss when he\Nleft the palace earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no way anyone could\Nhave predicted something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear this is more than\Nwe can handle on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already called\Nfor naval assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Vergo has stated\Nhe's mobilizing in response.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, splendid idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Monnet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you manning the palace gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're confused\Nabout what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should use your\Nclairvoyance to get a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be surprised by what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And while you're here, why don't you\Nwelcome our new royal family to the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The East Tower's been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates have reached the palace grounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They've taken Princess Viola hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is bigger than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get used to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master will love this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold! Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Doflamingo's men? Monet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of the princess at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you responsible for\NKing Riku's behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Move along!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a busy day ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with cleaning\Nup the palace grounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you attacking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no way to prevent\Nme from hurting my own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd rather be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, anyone, please kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we done something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always a fair\Nand just king to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You told us that you\Nneeded all of our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And we brought you everything we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you always put your people first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You were our pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, I can't believe you've\Nforsaken your kingdom like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He took our money and he\Nslaughtered our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He tossed us aside to\Nsatisfy his own desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, you monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\Nlow-down dirty scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the king's army! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come to rescue\Nthis broken kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So say hello to your new\Nruler, Don Quixote do Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're saving us from the royal army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you enjoying this dance, King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy? Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, it's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get out there and cleanse\Nthis country of its trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We somehow survived. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They embrace violence easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a single night, the kingdom fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the vile hands of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a terrible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, what a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How utterly ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I already hate that Doflamingo guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, we fell for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking that King Rick had lost his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,we reached out to the new king and were\Nduped into our current circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed of myself\Nforever trusting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be so frustrating to\Nknow that the once-beloved king
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,of this country was set up and\Ntragically died a hated man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, for King Rick is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Viola had an ability that\NDoflamingo was particularly drawn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So she made a bargain with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you promise to let my father\Nlive, then I'll submit to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just spare him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Still to this day, she works\Nunder Doflamingo's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Only now she is known as Violet,\None of the family officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an officer then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick is still alive,\Nthanks to her plea deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still out there somewhere,\Nperhaps in this kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,even but I cannot imagine the anguish\Nhe's carried with him these past 10 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,nor how hard this must be on the\Nformer princess: fear, anger, tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how she has fared\Nover this past decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There is also the lasting pain the\Nsoldiers have endured this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like King Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they were forced against their will into\Nviolent acts against their fellow citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't finish off the\Nroyal soldiers that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Some soldiers surrendered\Nto Doflamingo while
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,others weren't so lucky\Nand were slain into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The known survivors are currently\Nserving as guards for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get for nothing, sellouts perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so but I believe it must have been an\Nagonizing decision for them, murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They were only following\Norders of a deranged King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive them, and I will put these\Nblindly loyal soldiers to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, this story's chock\Nfull of betrayal, suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,These tears are rusting me, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,While a good number surrendered,\Nmany men lost their lives that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but even when you add up those numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't account for\Na kingdom's full army.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds strange, but it\Nseems I've lost some memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Others have too, and how\Ndoes that work exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a theory, Fralin? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You recall what I told you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When we are turned into toys, we retain\Nall our memories from when we were human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But people around us,\Nincluding our families,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,lose theirs and forget we\Neven existed in their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're completely unaware\Nthey've lost a loved one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even we toys can forget\Nsome details as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the most heartbreaking\Ntragedy Dressrosa faces. You mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it's possible that even some of the\Ntoys walking around town may have
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,forgotten about their friends and family\Nand that could include you as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,precisely but I do believe even\Nwith their muddled minds that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone turned into a toy must\Nfeel vengeful towards Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo attempted to\Nbury the will of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but that naturally only fueled\Nthe rage and insurgency dwelling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,within the shadows of this\Nkingdom they long for revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to our victory\Nlies with them—that unknown
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,quantity of downtrodden\Nand silenced individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,individuals I'm on the same page now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're counting on that advantage\Nto win this thing, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,While the folks gathered\Nhere may not be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,manpower to take on a\Nwarlord and his lackeys,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you're betting that if you can recruit\Nall the downtrodden toys to join you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll give you that extra edge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously getting yourself\Npumped up to take down Doflamingo, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only objective here is\Nto destroy the damn factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ditching this place\Nonce it's mission complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Back me up, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you, Doflamingo.\NYeah! What she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Today will go down as\Nthe day of reckoning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning's incident was\Na challenge from our enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no mere coincidence that\Nbrave Oceland came to us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Intervention is\Ntelling us to fight! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What incident again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The flamingo's brief\Nabdication from the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine the joy we felt\Nwhen we heard word of the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought it was a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,when we found it was a false report,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we felt as if we had dropped\Nfrom the edge of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,into the boiling pits of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, instead of being\Ntrapped in our despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we decided to take the final stand today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's on us, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, I've yet to find a\Nsuccessor to the Haposui army.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had a grandson to take my place,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,unfortunate—it's not\Neasy being a pirate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just my imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel like I'm forgetting something I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,experienced a phenomenon\Nlike this about 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, where am I going, grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you gotta help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no—what have they done\Nto Abdullah? The lone wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What have they done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheat the maverick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the maverick
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Warrior! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That stupid roosterhead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me he was going to show me\Nthe way, but then he passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Zoro even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, keep him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm up here, you guys! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop yelling so loud, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So you met with the green-haired man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was somewhat reticent\Nabout trusting him at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but he seemed quite eager to\Noffer his assistance to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He just, like, passed out or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Passed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with that guy? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joker is ordering me\Nto murder Straw Hat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure it's done before\Nthe competition ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You do want to become an executive\Nof the family, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, maybe\Nhe's sick or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was acting real weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's like a\Nmaze in here, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are Bellamy, so\Nhave you murdered him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you haven't you big dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenger? I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're standing there\Nand not murdering Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then I say you're not busy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me to give you a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Puss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a lot stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We expected you'd screw it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you know, it doesn't\Nmatter if you fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, the whole thing never\Nmattered in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The assassination order was mostly just\Nan attempt to get you out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's annoying how you keep trying\Nto win our approval. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to finish\Nyou off right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On the Young Master's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be. Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said\Nthat part out loud, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants me dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Scalpel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape me, rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And shovels!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That opiopi fruit of yours is handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I did notice, there seems to be a\Nlimit to how much you can use its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How much more have you got, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullet string.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, now what? Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tres Rosas, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in the middle of\Nsome business right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet betrayed us, and\Nshe's making a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as Blackleg is still alive, I\Nsuppose I should have expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.56,0:17:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,needless to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we weren't able to use\Nher glare glare power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to figure out what the\NStraw Hats were up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still in the dark on that, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's all under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's the deal: I need you to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Loud! You and the others to the\Nentrance of the Smile Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa—no, can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already announced that those guys\Nwill be participating in the finals the.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowds gonna be angry—stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You make it sound like\NI'm some kind of genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what you are, my friend—no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing of a sort honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who can do\Nthis fine—I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, galik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to act as a decoy\Nto keep me busy. Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats are planning to destroy\Nmy factory—even if you die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the factory's destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,your plan succeeds\Nbecause Kaido will kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,when I can no longer\Nproduce smiles for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how your scenario goes, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you used up your power too quickly\Nand hardly bought any time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Straw Hats can't seem\Nto pull it together—either
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you went on about how you\Nwere just using them—but if
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't have the utmost\Nfaith in Straw Hat and his
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,crew then the plan would\Nnever work in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.91,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,never work in the first place so\NBut where does that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you trust that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know that the\ND will bring a new storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did you need me for, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, there's a tournament\Ngoing on and you didn't even tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to fight too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're letting\Nthat old man kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I beat him in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Bastille!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, that was Pirate\NHunter Zoro back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And the guy in the\NColiseum he's talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost positive\Nthat's Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So he was the winner from Block C?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains why he was so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it looks like Smoker had it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we capture them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let's leave them be for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it for a second. As we speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that coliseum is swimming\Nwith infamous pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,deadly bounty hunters and mercenaries\Nfrom all over the new world?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we could burst in\Nthere and capture Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but that would make a scene we\Ndon't want to alert the others yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wait for all of those snakes to\Nslither their way out of the coliseum,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll fall right into our trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then we can capture the lot\Nof them in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,who's been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Biggest is Don Chinjou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's Usai, Boo, and Abdullah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who were we supposed to capture again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I using this snail correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sanji requested that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I call him once we found Sir Luffy. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Coliseum is surrounded\Nby marines by the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,way that was our big news\Nand you don't even care
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:21:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The transponder snail is ringing.\NMust be Kinemo if that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,case then please allow me to answer\Nthis is the sunny here hey it's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,me hi lucy all right chopper now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,call us off on the other one this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everybody we're missing? Law,\Nbut he can catch up with the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, I'm give us a status update.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,please we made
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,some friends guys
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They call themselves the King Rick\Narmy, sworn enemies of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,an army of little people it's a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.51,0:21:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,top You remember
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,that toy soldier dude we met in\Nfront of the Coliseum earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, but about the little people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that toy is the\Ncommander of this here army.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the little people? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And the thing is, this army is planning\Non taking down Doflamingo, like, pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.82,0:22:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.46,0:22:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that he can save this kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but he wants to sacrifice\Nhis life to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I heard something about that soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, Rebecca said she\Nwants to stop him. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the army to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to do the exact opposite of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, wait, you said you talked to Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and she's really nice,\Nso I want to help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though she's poor, she\Nbought me three lunchboxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But when she went to fight,\Nthe whole audience hated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with you on that one, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm sorry, but I don't\Nthink I can follow Traffy's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:22:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Franky, where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me lay this out how I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to destroy\Nthe Smile Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but then we keep Doflamingo\Naround to use against Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It just ain't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens to all the people who\Nwant to take that bastard down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.02,0:23:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though this kingdom\Nseems like a happy place,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,these guys know how dark it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,they're getting ready to strike down\Nthat darkness with all they've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it costs them their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.34,0:23:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, they're small, but they've\Ngot some really big balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This little army is brave as hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,staring down an enemy that's pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not right to just\Ndestroy the factory and bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.02,0:23:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Doflamingo's in\Ncharge, that's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:24:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I think you're a\Ngreat captain and all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't make it this time. He'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick some ass out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.44,0:24:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll back you up real soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.00,0:24:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It always ends up this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.60,0:24:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the city under attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.52,0:24:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Isho, sir, there's a big\Nfight happening in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.90,0:24:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got something going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This does not look promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.24,0:24:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see You guys okay? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Vice Admiral Bastille?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.48,0:25:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.94,0:25:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.30,0:25:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy, why are you fighting with Mingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.56,0:25:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You just had to push your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Trophy!
